---
---

<section class="mb-24 bg-[#F0EDE8] rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-12 relative overflow-hidden border border-[#E6E1D8]">
  <!-- Decorative background glyph -->
  <div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 text-[#1B1B18]/5 select-none pointer-events-none">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[280px] leading-none">play_arrow</span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1080px] mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#C1592B] inline-block"></span>
      <span class="font-sans text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C1592B] font-semibold">
        Special Feature • Audience Mechanics
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      <!-- Left Editorial Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[32px] sm:text-[38px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal tracking-tight leading-tight">
          94,000+ Strong: Lessons in Organic Audience Scaling
        </h2>
        <p class="font-sans text-[17px] text-[#1B1B18] leading-relaxed">
          Growing an authentic audience without paid promotion requires turning video production into an exact discipline of empathy, algorithmic tension, and editorial rigor.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-[#1B1B18]/75 font-sans text-[14px] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Rather than treating YouTube as an ephemeral feed, we approached it as an indexed video repository. Every piece was reverse-engineered from query intent, structured thumbnail packaging, and sharp 30-second retention thresholds.
          </p>
          <p>
            The compounding momentum came through disciplined packaging tests paired with active community dialogue in the comments—converting passive viewers into long-term patrons.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric Bars -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-[#1B1B18]/15">
          <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
            <span class="block font-serif text-[28px] text-[#C1592B] font-normal">94.2k</span>
            <span class="block font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1B1B18]/70 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">Subscribers</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8]">
            <span class="block font-serif text-[28px] text-[#1B1B18] font-normal">11.4M</span>
            <span class="block font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1B1B18]/70 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">Lifetime Impr.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded border border-[#E6E1D8] col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
            <span class="block font-serif text-[28px] text-[#1F3A3D] font-normal">68.4%</span>
            <span class="block font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1B1B18]/70 uppercase tracking-wider font-medium">Search &amp; Suggested</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Mosaic Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-3">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-[#E6E1D8] space-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-video relative rounded overflow-hidden bg-[#F0EDE8] border border-[#1B1B18]/10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 text-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[36px] text-[#C1592B] mb-2">video_library</span>
            <span class="font-sans text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#1B1B18] uppercase tracking-wider">Flagship Case Breakdown</span>
            <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#1B1B18]/60 mt-1">Packaging Tension &amp; Query Intent</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-1">
            <span class="font-sans text-[11px] text-[#C1592B] uppercase font-semibold tracking-wider">Channel Methodology</span>
            <p class="font-serif text-[16px] leading-snug text-[#1B1B18] font-medium mt-0.5">
              The Architecture of Organic Reach: Building High-Agency Distribution
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-1 text-right">
          <a
            href="https://youtube.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans text-[12px] text-[#1F3A3D] hover:text-[#C1592B] font-mono transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Channel: @onerishi</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">open_in_new</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
